<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Tigon Ltd raises year profits sharply.</title>
<headline>Tigon Ltd raises year profits sharply.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended January 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	     32.7  vs 7.05</p>
<p>    Div (cts)			  -    vs  -</p>
<p>    Attrib income		   33.18 vs 7.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			   33.18 vs 7.05</p>
<p>    Tax				  -    vs  -</p>
<p>    Net Interest received	  2.19 vs 1.50</p>
<p>    Turnover			 115.33 vs 32.64</p>
<p>Full name: Tigon Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said the previous year's EPS had been adjusted to for a share split of 10:1 during the year.</p>
<p>It said no dividend is proposed so that the funds retained can be immediately used to add shareholder value.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
